+## Question timer
+
+Quiz **Settings** includes **Timer minutes** and **Timer seconds**, both defaulting
+to 0. Set both to 0 for unlimited time. New games use this duration for every
+question; a countdown appears only on the moderator's big screen in M:SS format.
